---
flowchart LR
    A[(Raw electoral<br/>bulletins · PDF)] -->|Claude API| B[Identify candidate's<br/>bulletin coordinates<br/> · JSON]
    B -->|PuMuPDF & PIL| C[Crop each district pdf at the candidate level]
    C -->|Yomitoku OCR| D[Extract metadata<br/>and text]
    D --> E[(Pandas<br/>dataframe)]
    E --> F([Text complexity<br/>measures])
    E --> G([Structural topic<br/>model])
    E --> H([Party centrality<br/> measure])

    classDef data fill:#fff8e1,stroke:#f9a825,color:#4e342e
    classDef process fill:#e3f2fd,stroke:#1565c0,color:#0d2a4a
    classDef analysis fill:#e8f5e9,stroke:#2e7d32,color:#1b3d1f
    class A,E data
    class B,C,D process
    class F,G,H analysis
